# Mercury Assistant - Cursor Rules

## Project Context
This is the Mercury Assistant project - an AI agent system with RAG capabilities, built using:
- Haystack for agent orchestration
- LangChain for research tools
- NVIDIA AI endpoints for LLM inference
- A web interface for user interaction

## Important Reference Files

### NVIDIA Model Catalog
Location: `/home/milos/06_Playground/NVIDIA_MODEL_CATALOG.md`
Contains: Available NVIDIA AI Foundation model endpoints, context windows, LangChain integration code, and usage notes.

